  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m  Manifest to publish: dist/contoso/manifest.prod.xml (created by the real run)
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m  A. TEST FOR ONE PERSON (local sideload, recommended first)
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     1. Open Outlook on the web, then go to https://aka.ms/olksideload
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     2. My add-ins > Custom add-ins > Add a custom add-in > Add from file...
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     3. Choose the manifest file. Classic Outlook: Get Add-ins > My add-ins >
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m        Add a custom add-in > From file.
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m  B. DEPLOY FOR EVERYONE (centralized deployment)
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     1. Microsoft 365 admin center > Settings > Integrated apps
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     2. Upload custom apps > App type: Office Add-in > upload the manifest file
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     3. Choose the users or groups (start with a pilot group), accept the
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m        permissions (ReadWriteItem) and finish. Propagation: up to 24 hours.
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m     Update: upload the new manifest with the same Id and a higher version.
  [38;2;74;158;230m│[0m
